hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch oonton [panch zawd] se kam mein koi sadqa [zakat] nahin.'"
"354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch oonton se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur paanch ausaq [paidawar] se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khajoor ke paanch ausaq se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch ooqiya [chandi] se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur paanch ooqiya se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
"359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur chandi [wariq] ke paanch ooqiya se kam mein koi sadqa nahin.'"
